 citation-type="journal">Brock, J., K. Midwinter, J. Lewis, and P. Martin. <year>1996</year>. Healing of incisional wounds on the embryonic chick wing bud: characterization of the actin purse-string and demonstration of a requirement for Rho activation. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>135</volume>:<fpage>1097</fpage>&#x02013;1107.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8922389</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal">Campbell, R.E., O. Tour, A.E. Palmer, P.A. Steinbach, G.S. Baird, D.A. Zacharias, and R.Y. Tsien. <year>2002</year>. A monomeric red fluorescent protein. <source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA.</source> <volume>99</volume>:<fpage>7877</fpage>&#x02013;7882.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12060735</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal">Canman, J.C., and W.M. Bement. <year>1997</year>. Microtubules suppress actomyosin-based cortical flow in <italic>Xenopus</italic> oocytes. <source>J. Cell Sci.</source> <volume>110</volume>:<fpage>1907</fpage>&#x02013;1917.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9296390</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal">DerMardirossian, C., A. Schnelzer, and G.M. Bokoch. <year>2004</year>. Phosphorylation of RhoGDI by Pak1 mediates dissociation of Rac GTPase. <source>Mol. Cell.</source> <volume>15</volume>:<fpage>117</fpage>&#x02013;127.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15225553</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal">Drivas, G.T., A. Shih, E. Coutavas, M.G. Rush, and P. D'Eustachio. <year>1990</year>. Characterization of four novel ras-like genes expressed in a human teratocarcinoma cell line. <source>Mol. Cell. Biol.</source> <volume>10</volume>:<fpage>1793</fpage>&#x02013;1798.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2108320</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal">Fenteany, G., P.A. Janmey, and T.P. Stossel. <year>2000</year>. Signaling pathways and cell mechanics involved in wound closure by epithelial cell